## Estate denominator

The governed registry remains a 38-chat point-in-time census. A fresh bounded app census exposes 15 project chats, 10 of which are not in that registry. The defensible current denominator is therefore **at least 48 chats**, not exactly 48. Recency pagination and active or newly changing source chats prevent a complete estate proof.

V13 raises the exact unique outer-package count from 42 to **47**. That is a current lower-bound collection state, not “all packages collected.”

